Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tod
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comma
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other end ofife,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being crushed to death,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Copy craft.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much money can you\Ncreate for the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and I am in a profit.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether it may be my eyes, I'm going\Nto shake my hand out of my hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep going on the road.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the target I'm not going to be able
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,break my heart I'm going\Nto be able to forget
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.22,0:01:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tomorrow I'm going to take back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be able to do it\NI'm going to be able to do it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.08,0:01:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:02:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to keep Black or Greymon from\Ndisintegrating another Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting way out of hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.60,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fscx120\fscy120\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(317,323)}Assault! BlackWarGreymon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to him, Black or Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love a good fox hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if, in this case, the\Nfoxes really are Mojyamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You abominable snowbrains, your\Nattacks are useless against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just tell us where the destiny stone\Nis, it's obvious you're no match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt, you were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Standing force!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew those Mojyamon weren't smart enough\Nto hide the Destiny Stone on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:02:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm really that stupid that\NI would just tell you where we hid it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now who could that be all\Nthe way up here in the north?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me it isn't Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Black War Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple-minded fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.84,0:03:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter where you hide the\NDestiny Stone, I can find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sense where it is instinctively.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.24,0:03:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.39,0:03:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for Davis's hiding spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terror Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you are the worthy opponent\NI have been looking for,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why do you not show yourself and fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terror Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm one step further\Nto finding my opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one more Destiny Stone should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better keep him under wraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gets stronger with every\NDestiny Stone he destroys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I know that, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we have to follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we lost another Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what they give me to work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.82,0:04:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can mope about it later, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.28,0:04:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to return to the real\Nworld before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close. It'll\Nbe worse next time if
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we lose those last destiny\Nstones but we still
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,haven't found a way to\Nprotect them against
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.48,0:05:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,black war greymon I don't\Nwant to hear that name
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again you mean black war\Ngreymon thanks for not
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,saying it I guess we're\Nall pretty frustrated
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,black war greymon has\Nreally pushed us to our
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.44,0:05:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,limits not quite huh\Nlet's stop all this talk
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.86,0:05:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about losing and\Nhelplessness we're going to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stop black war greymon\Nand that's that I've seen
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K. angry like this before?\NNot again... Not again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like when\NAngemon fought Devimon and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sacrificed himself to save me blackboard
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,greymon is just like\Nkameramon a creation of evil
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's out of control\Nand won't stop until the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whole digital world is in\Nruins the world will end
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is everybody with me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's getting late i've got to get home\Nit must be tough having to take that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long bus ride back to Tamachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm used to it by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come over to my
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.74,0:06:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,house for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can brainstorm ideas\Nabout how to defeat Black War
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.01,0:06:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, my mom, she makes\Na pretty decent meatloaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all we've been through, I'm\Nglad you include me in your fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't mind\Nsettling my score with Aru
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kunemon either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you sleep over?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And tomorrow, we can have a big\NDigidestined meeting over at my house, cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me just call my mom first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't make it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I come over tonight too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too. Really, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't you all\Ncome to dinner at my house tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I've got plans tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.42,0:07:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks anyway, but I can't make it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder why TK gets so emotional when\Nhe talks about the powers of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, TK, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll walk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we live in the same building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Ichijoji residence. Hi, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.34,0:07:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, I was invited to sleep\Nover at a friend's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ken, how wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I pack you an overnight\Nbag and some sandwiches?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His parents made dinner, and\NI'll borrow some pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, dear, have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you finally have\Nsome friends to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken and I play soccer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some people even think he's\Nalmost as good a player as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Kenichi Joji, the famous\Nboy genius in my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.44,0:07:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, could you help my\Nson with his homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:07:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spent a fortune on tutors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we have\Na celebrity right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.82,0:08:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A celebrity?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do they think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Matt, some kid is here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if he's a better singer\Nthan you, he's hired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK was angry when the Digimon\NEmperor created Chimeramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would be, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yum, yum, yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can see why you're worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK can be a real hothead sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all has something to do\Nwith the powers of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, it was Chimera-mon who was created\Nfrom pure evil and now Black War Greymon,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.98,0:08:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who was created from evil control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That plus TK equals angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is starting to make\Na lot of sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me if anything happened\Nbefore to TK to make him like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not sure TK would like it if\NI told you, but something did happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but TK still carries\Nthe scars from the final
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,battle between us and our first opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon at the fade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:09:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon used the powers of darkness because\Nhe thought it would make him invincible,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Angemon used up all of\Nhis own energy to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon knew he would be reconfigured\Nafterwards, but he did it anyway to save TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK was scared because it was the first\Ntime Patamon had ever Digivolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he thought he'd never see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of us knew that much\Nabout Digimon back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.38,0:09:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we all thought we had\Nseen the last of Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that fear never really left TK,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or the lesson that the importance of\Nlife outweighs the power of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has never gotten over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all these years,\Nit still has an effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be awfully hard to lose your\NDigimon partner before your very eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken and Wormmon went through the\Nexact same thing. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken probably knows exactly what T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't surprise me if Ken\Nfeels the same way as T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about someone playing around\Nwith the powers of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything were to happen to\NUpamon, I don't know what I'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:09:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone who has a Digimon partner\Nfeels exactly that way, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so lucky being Digidestined\Nreally has its perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I had to bother you\Ndoing your band rehearsal, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks again. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder why T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has never told them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Penny for your thoughts, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd offer more, but I'm short on cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to stop Black War\NGreymon as much as T .K. does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know that terrible things will happen\Nif he destroys the last Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but something about\NBlack War Greymon makes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me think he's just confused\Nand not really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what's bothering you\Nabout Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because he has a heart and he\Nworries about things just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you can't destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you have the\Nbiggest heart of anyone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you made Cody feel\Nbetter about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.76,0:11:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk to you later. Okay, later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody should have come to me\Nfirst instead of asking Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's just like Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid thinks too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We watch both worlds fall apart if the\Nlast two Destiny Stones are destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to protect them somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's go find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had lunch with Tentomon the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he said he was searching for\Nthe location of the last two stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.66,0:11:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can find them before Black War\NGreymon does, we can protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had lunch with Tentomon the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come I wasn't invited?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, even if we find\Nthe Destiny Stones first,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're still not powerful enough\Nto stop Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's get stronger,\Nright, kid? Right, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where, where, where is that destiny stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I destroy it, I might be able to\Nfind the one opponent worth fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel a deep sense of satisfaction\Ndestroying these pathetic control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, isn't it enough that he's\Ndestroying the destiny stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he have to ruin my\Nprecious control spires too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, big fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do, ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've made him mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I might need\Nmouth-to-mouth resuscitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, get off me, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blackwar Koromon is acting just like a big\Ncrybaby who can't find his favorite toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we'd better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an incredibly\Ndangerous crybaby. A baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he's our child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to be a papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not a daddy, you're a mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.12,0:13:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now keep following him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.24,0:13:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if all the Destiny\NStones are destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if there are no more control spires\Nstanding, it'll all be for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now step on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel the Destiny Stone is nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.54,0:13:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't follow him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We seem to have reached\Na dead end, my precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see that for myself, Mummymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Digimon wannabe still has\Nno idea why he was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought I was being attacked by\NArukenymon, but it's just Davis' snoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you awake yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember setting\Nmy clock radio on laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.32,0:13:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be having a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, Kari's on the phone for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know I'm dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just heard from Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said Ikkakumon and his friends\Njust found the sixth Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.12,0:14:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's at the bottom of the ocean, and\NBlack War Greymon is headed right for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken and I will meet you and the\Nothers in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, we'll leave the\Nunderwater stuff to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon and I will try our best\Nto protect the Destiny Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we're going to need some\Nhelp against Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Submarimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our job to stop Black War\NGreymon from getting into the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might as well try to\Nstop the sun from shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in the digital world, anything's\Npossible, so let's try our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I just never get tired of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you, Cody? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Seadramon brought\Nalong reinforcements!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.80,0:15:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dolphmon are playful champion\NDigimon of the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you wouldn't find them too playful if
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.58,0:15:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they hit you with their\Npulse blast attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that Submarimon is here, there's\Nno way we could possibly lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not get overconfident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys have never seen\Nanything like Black War, Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel the Destiny Stone's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-Beamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you like?\NThe carrot or the stick?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's all attack at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready for my static horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand of faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.66,0:16:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra-destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing that's Black War Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:16:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon Vulcan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,House West!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.20,0:17:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oxygen torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Staring Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that takes care\Nof him once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does he think he is, Moses?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is the digital world\Nequivalent of the Red Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.34,0:18:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.66,0:18:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't take another step or else\Nor else what um i haven't figured
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that part out yet cody get out of\Nthere he'll kill you prepare to die
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait don't attack i know that you have\Na heart even though you were made from
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,control spires so please try to find it in
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your heart not to destroy any more destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stones we want to be friends with you i\Nhope cody knows what he's doing if i do not
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destroy the destiny stones then I will\Nnever get to fight my only worthy opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't fight him, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.50,0:18:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're disturbing the balance between\Nthe real world and the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.40,0:18:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you to tell me not to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my ultimate destiny to be\Nthe greatest fighter ever created.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only thought now is destroying the\NDestiny Stone so I can meet my opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have cleared my mind at such petty\Nthings as worrying and feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I am finally focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out of my way or die! Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to destroy this destiny\Nstone, you'll have to destroy me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a heart, and I\Ndon't want to fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does my heart have to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, the flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I remember that silly\Nlittle flower at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I so hesitant to destroy this boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.98,0:19:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it because I have a heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never said I wanted a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.73,0:19:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black tornado!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We let another Destiny Stone get blasted!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here before we're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cody! Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come Blackwater Greymon was ready\Nto hurt you but you wouldn't hurt him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.72,0:20:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some Digimon don't appreciate\Nhow precious life is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it would be great if all\NDigimon were like you, Upamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you for the way you\Nhandled yourself back there, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.36,0:20:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you finally understand why I\Nget so angry at the thought of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.13,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.64,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm going to\Nget to the end of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to connect with my hand,\Nand I'm going to run together.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.06,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think I'm going to get to the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.32,0:21:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end of
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.25,0:22:03.25,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.84,0:22:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.94,0:22:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always going to go.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.25,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all wonderful and so\Non. You're always going to be
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.26,0:22:17.18,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all just one.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.18,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.30,0:22:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,junto You're all
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.64,0:22:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.78,0:22:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.02,0:23:01.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx120\fscy120\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(315,323)}The Steel Angel, Shakkoumon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.78,0:23:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.

